OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1786760288
OL,3,CDon't light fires in 'tinderbox'
OL,4,CBritain, says Andy Burnham before
OL,5,Cfarms meeting
OL,7,FAndy Burnham has urged members of the
OL,8,Fpublic not to light fires in
OL,9,F"tinderbox" Britain, ahead of a
OL,10,Fmeeting with farmers whom he warned
OL,11,Fare "at the sharp end of a changing
OL,12,Fclimate".
OL,14,FThe Prime Minister is set to unveil a
OL,15,F#65 million funding package for
OL,16,Ffarmers at the weekend, amid fears
OL,17,Fhot, dry weather could drive up food
OL,18,Fprices on supermarket shelves.
OL,26,@qD@AOUqD@KO]sD@EOUtD@HO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1786760288
OL,3,CDon't light fires in 'tinderbox'
OL,4,CBritain, says Andy Burnham before
OL,5,Cfarms meeting
OL,7,FHis announcement will follow his visit
OL,8,Fto Stourbridge in the West Midlands,
OL,9,Fwhere a wildfire spread across more
OL,10,Fthan 500 acres and destroyed 19 homes
OL,11,Fearlier this week.
OL,13,FIn the town, he announced a temporary
OL,14,Fban on disposable barbecues, and he
OL,15,Flater urged home cooks and gardeners
OL,16,Fto "take extra care" by not lighting
OL,17,Fany fires "in gardens, the countryside
OL,18,For other open spaces, including parks,
OL,19,Fmoorland and wooded areas".
OL,26,@xD@DOUxD@TO]yD@KOU{D@ZO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1786760288
OL,3,CDon't light fires in 'tinderbox'
OL,4,CBritain, says Andy Burnham before
OL,5,Cfarms meeting
OL,7,FMillions of people in England and
OL,8,FWales received an alert on their
OL,9,Fmobile devices on Friday evening,
OL,10,Fwarning them of "a very high risk of
OL,11,Fwildfires nationally".
OL,13,FMr Burnham said the emergency alert
OL,14,Fsystem was triggered at the request of
OL,15,Ffire and rescue officers.
OL,17,FFriday was provisionally a record-
OL,18,Fbreaking 10th day in 2026 where
OL,19,Ftemperatures have exceeded 35C or
OL,20,Fmore, according to the Met Office.
OL,26,@rD@QOUsD@UO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1786760288
OL,3,CDon't light fires in 'tinderbox'
OL,4,CBritain, says Andy Burnham before
OL,5,Cfarms meeting
OL,7,FFrittenden, near Ashford in Kent, was
OL,8,Famong the hottest places, where
OL,9,Ftemperatures reached 35.3C.
OL,11,FThe Prime Minister is expected to tell
OL,12,Ffarmers in South West England that
OL,13,F"the ability to grow our own food is
OL,14,Fnational security" and will promise to
OL,15,F"treat it that way".
OL,26,@uD@AOUvD@RO]wD@AOUwD@SO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1786760288
OL,3,CDon't light fires in 'tinderbox'
OL,4,CBritain, says Andy Burnham before
OL,5,Cfarms meeting
OL,7,FHe will also say "farmers are at the
OL,8,Fsharp end of a changing climate, and
OL,9,Fthey should not be carrying that risk
OL,10,Falone" and that he understands the
OL,11,Fimpact of "lower income, higher costs,
OL,12,Fand no rain in the forecast".
OL,14,FThe new funding package will go
OL,15,Ftowards supporting environmentally
OL,16,Ffriendly food production methods
OL,17,Fthrough the Sustainable Farming
OL,18,FIncentive (SFI), with an extra #50
OL,19,Fmillion for this year's pot ` bringing
OL,20,Fthe total SFI budget to #290 million.
OL,26,@oD@ROUrD@FO]sD@KOUtD@\O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1786760288
OL,3,CDon't light fires in 'tinderbox'
OL,4,CBritain, says Andy Burnham before
OL,5,Cfarms meeting
OL,7,FFarmers will also get #15 million in
OL,8,Fsupport for building on-farm
OL,9,Freservoirs to provide supplies during
OL,10,Ffuture dry summers.
OL,12,FAnnouncing an earlier set of measures
OL,13,Fon Friday, Mr Burnham warned "Britain
OL,14,Fis a tinderbox right now" with "37
OL,15,Ffires smouldering around the country".
OL,26,@uD@^OUvD@YO]vD@`OUwD@eO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
