PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1786760288
OL,3,CDon't light fires in 'tinderbox'
OL,4,CBritain, says Andy Burnham before
OL,5,Cfarms meeting
OL,7,FHe said 100 military personnel ` from
OL,8,FQueen's Own Gurkha Logistic Regiment,
OL,9,Fsupported by the 22 Engineer Regiment
OL,10,F` had been deployed to South Wales to
OL,11,Foffer "critically needed" support to
OL,12,Ffight fires throughout the region.
OL,14,FAmong their equipment are four water
OL,15,Fbowsers, each capable of storing and
OL,16,Ftransporting 20,000 litres of water,
OL,17,Fand a further 100 members of the Armed
OL,18,FForces were deployed on Friday evening.
OL,26,@sD@GOUsD@YO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/18
