PN,30408
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1786760288
OL,3,CDon't light fires in 'tinderbox'
OL,4,CBritain, says Andy Burnham before
OL,5,Cfarms meeting
OL,7,FAerial firefighting capacity, such as
OL,8,Fhelicopters to dampen flames, will be
OL,9,Fcommissioned at a national level, the
OL,10,FPrime Minister added.
OL,12,FHe also said: "The temporary ban on
OL,13,Fbarbecues, disposable barbecues, comes
OL,14,Fin today.
OL,16,F"All retailers will be receiving
OL,17,Fnotification of that ban, and we ask
OL,18,Fthem to, obviously, implement it in
OL,19,Ffull until further notice when we can
OL,20,Fremove it."
OL,26,@tD@OOUxD@AOU|D@KO]
