OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1786760288
OL,3,CDon't light fires in 'tinderbox'
OL,4,CBritain, says Andy Burnham before
OL,5,Cfarms meeting
OL,7,F"Our firefighters and emergency
OL,8,Fresponders are working around the
OL,9,Fclock in incredibly difficult
OL,10,Fconditions."
OL,12,FThe alert was "the most extensive use"
OL,13,Fof the UK's mobile phone alert system,
OL,14,FCabinet Office minister Louise Haigh
OL,15,Fsaid.
OL,26,@oD@AOUrD@LO]tD@OOUtD@fO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/18
