PN,30411
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1786760288
OL,3,CDon't light fires in 'tinderbox'
OL,4,CBritain, says Andy Burnham before
OL,5,Cfarms meeting
OL,7,FShadow environment secretary Victoria
OL,8,FAtkins criticised Mr Burnham, saying
OL,9,Fhe "has been slow in realising that
OL,10,Fmuch of the country has been in
OL,11,Fdrought for weeks, with terrible
OL,12,Fimpacts for future food prices due to
OL,13,Fpoor harvests".
OL,15,FThe Conservative frontbencher
OL,16,Fcontinued: "In reality, Labour are
OL,17,Foverseeing record farm closures,
OL,18,Fcutting the farming budget by #100m
OL,19,Fand slapping new death and fertiliser
OL,20,Ftaxes on family farms.
OL,26,@qD@DOUuD@NO]xD@LOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30412
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1786760288
OL,3,CDon't light fires in 'tinderbox'
OL,4,CBritain, says Andy Burnham before
OL,5,Cfarms meeting
OL,7,F"We welcome the Government adopting
OL,8,Fsome of the measures we have been
OL,9,Fdemanding for weeks and months now,
OL,10,Fparticularly around access to water,
OL,11,Fbut Labour has still failed to face up
OL,12,Fto the hardships it has dumped on
OL,13,Ffamily farms.
OL,26,@oD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30413
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1786760288
OL,3,CDon't light fires in 'tinderbox'
OL,4,CBritain, says Andy Burnham before
OL,5,Cfarms meeting
OL,7,F"Labour needs to work with the sector
OL,8,Fon winter forage, reverse its
OL,9,Fcontrolled heather-burning ban to help
OL,10,Fprevent wildfires, get a grip of
OL,11,Fbluetongue (a disease mainly spread by
OL,12,Fbiting midges affecting sheep and
OL,13,Fcattle), abolish the fertiliser tax
OL,14,Fand scrap its disastrous family farm
OL,15,Fand family business taxes to give
OL,16,Ffarmers a fighting chance and slow
OL,17,Frocketing food price inflation for the
OL,18,Fpublic."
OL,26,@oD@AOUzD@HO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30414
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1786760288
OL,3,CDon't light fires in 'tinderbox'
OL,4,CBritain, says Andy Burnham before
OL,5,Cfarms meeting
OL,7,FAlistair Carmichael, who chairs the
OL,8,FCommons Environment, Food and Rural
OL,9,FAffairs Committee, also urged the
OL,10,FGovernment to consider dropping plans
OL,11,Fto bring in a carbon levy ` known as
OL,12,Fthe carbon border adjustment mechanism
OL,13,F(CBAM) ` on fertiliser from January
OL,14,Fnext year.
OL,16,FHe told the Press Association that
OL,17,F"the price of fertiliser has
OL,18,Fskyrocketed" and also said farmers
OL,19,Fstruggle to get planning permission to
OL,20,Fbuild small reservoirs, regardless of
OL,21,Fwhether they have the funding.
OL,26,@yD@AOUzD@LO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G14/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30415
SC,0015
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1786760288
OL,3,CDon't light fires in 'tinderbox'
OL,4,CBritain, says Andy Burnham before
OL,5,Cfarms meeting
OL,7,FBringing small reservoirs into the
OL,8,Fpermitted development regime ` to
OL,9,Fbypass a full planning process `
OL,10,F"would be a quick and easy win", the
OL,11,FLiberal Democrat MP for Orkney and
OL,12,FShetland added.
OL,14,F"If farmers had the sense that the
OL,15,FGovernment was on their side instead
OL,16,Fof on their back all the time, then
OL,17,Factually the industry itself would
OL,18,Fcome up with investment," Mr
OL,19,FCarmichael told PA.
OL,26,@rD@AOUrD@_O]vD@AOUzD@YO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G15/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30416
SC,0016
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1786760288
OL,3,CDon't light fires in 'tinderbox'
OL,4,CBritain, says Andy Burnham before
OL,5,Cfarms meeting
OL,7,F"The biggest barrier to investment is
OL,8,Fconfidence and I think that if there
OL,9,Fwas just a few signals about making it
OL,10,Feasier to develop farming ` so
OL,11,Fplanning regulations, environmental
OL,12,Fregulations, on-farm reservoirs ` then
OL,13,Fthe farming community themselves would
OL,14,Fhave the confidence to go out and
OL,15,Fborrow, and banks would be prepared to
OL,16,Flend."
OL,26,@oD@AOUxD@FO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G16/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30417
SC,0017
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1786760288
OL,3,CDon't light fires in 'tinderbox'
OL,4,CBritain, says Andy Burnham before
OL,5,Cfarms meeting
OL,7,FMr Carmichael also warned a
OL,8,F"phenomenal number of people" were
OL,9,Fliving with the effects of wildfires,
OL,10,Fincluding "farmers, gamekeepers,
OL,11,Fshepherds, land managers".
OL,13,FFood producers earlier this week
OL,14,Fwarned fruit, vegetable and grain
OL,15,Fsupply chains were affected by this
OL,16,Fsummer's heatwaves.
OL,26,@pD@AOUpD@]O]rD@KOUsD@YO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G17/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
