FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30418
SC,0018
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1786760288
OL,3,CDon't light fires in 'tinderbox'
OL,4,CBritain, says Andy Burnham before
OL,5,Cfarms meeting
OL,7,FDr Liliana Danila, chief economist at
OL,8,Fthe Food and Drink Federation, said:
OL,9,F"Competition for fewer resources will
OL,10,Fin turn push up the price of
OL,11,Fingredients for manufacturers.
OL,13,F"The UK's food and drink manufacturers
OL,14,Fwork hard to absorb costs where they
OL,15,Fcan, but are already grappling with
OL,16,Frising costs as a result of war in
OL,17,FUkraine and in Iran, so we expect the
OL,18,Fadditional upward pressure of reduced
OL,19,Fcrops will be reflected in retail
OL,20,Fprices into next year."
OL,26,@qD@AOUuD@AOU|D@WO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G18/18
